					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I keep forgetting to announce things! <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/the-book-of-mathisi-chapter-1">The Parable Of The Three Princes</a> is the first chapter in my Horizon Initiative format series, the Book Of Mathisi. The Book of Mathisi is about a man named Mathisi who speaks with Jesus Christ during the time of the New Testament, and talks with him about the anomalous world and how Christ's teachings relate to it. It's essentially an exploration of the New Testament and how it would interact with the anomalous world. The first chapter explores the relationship between Christianity and the Sarkics and Mekhanites, as well as how Christianity would view them, in the form of a biblical-style parable.</p> 
